5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am worried about the time it takes to manage the money.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to know the actual costs before setting any fees.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,The current system feels fragile. We need stability for everyone.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,People are hesitating to come out. The atmosphere is changing.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Some people do all the work. Others barely show up.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, do you have the numbers for last year?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,Not yet. I need to check the ledger and the bank records.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,I agree. We cannot guess. We need facts.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I think the hesitation is about commitment. It feels heavy.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I want to see who is actually attending versus who is paying.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will look at the treasurer's hours and the sign-ups.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the ledger and the bank statements.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will look at the taster forms and the winter social notes.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will check the weekday turnout and the sign-in sheets.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the rota and the sign-in sheets.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,It is important to know the burden on the next person.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Precision is better than estimation. We will see what the data says.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,Let us find out what is slipping before we fix it.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I hope we can make it feel lighter for everyone.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let the numbers speak. Then we can decide.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
